                            transaction, every time.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card reveal">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i>
                        <h3>Fast Shipping</h3>
                        <p>Complimentary express delivery on all orders
                            over $150.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card reveal">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i>
                        <h3>Gift Wrapping</h3>
                        <p>Add a personalised note and hand-tied ribbon
                            to any order.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card reveal">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i>
                        <h3>Easy Returns</h3>
                        <p>30-day hassle-free returns on every unopened
                            fragrance.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
